ed, read the hermits thoughts, teleport instantly, and attract visits from heavenly beings.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-11T00:44:44.187Z"},{"id":"UKPBInFetYxVZ4EpbghD","lessonId":"gOhNHUeile2cqARBoexs","studentName":"Lily htike","userId":"uTkdJG2fRMSo1eC66WzHfhPAiby2","questionIndex":1,"answerContent":"in the picture it looks like the dragon wants to fight with Buddha","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-11T00:20:39.069Z"},{"id":"WJbTEW66UNLQDkCUytlg","lessonId":"gOhNHUeile2cqARBoexs","studentName":"Lily htike","userId":"uTkdJG2fRMSo1eC66WzHfhPAiby2","questionIndex":8,"answerContent":"The Buddha waited for the hermits pride to drop because he knew that the hermit would become a very reliable and a important figure","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-11T00:36:06.416Z"},{"id":"WoC5hymMPQIpKdvSL2fv","lessonId":"gOhNHUeile2cqARBoexs","studentName":"Lily htike","userId":"uTkdJG2fRMSo1eC66WzHfhPAiby2","questionIndex":9,"answerContent":"The Buddha did not tell the hermit right away","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-11T00:37:48.282Z"},{"id":"XVr9pF9arPkKtqHxYqd7","lessonId":"gOhNHUeile2cqARBoexs","studentName":"Lily htike","userId":"uTkdJG2fRMSo1eC66WzHfhPAiby2","questionIndex":10,"answerContent":"Uruvela, Nadi, and Gaya","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-11T00:39:50.919Z"},{"id":"XwBWHmwgjAI3GkcabBJE","lessonId":"gOhNHUeile2cqARBoexs","studentName":"Mabel Naing","userId":"16685285020362320583","questionIndex":2,"answerContent":"They are showing their respect for the Buddha.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-07-17T20:46:36.732Z"},{"id":"Yf9IztafpPtmRBPs4CF1","lessonId":"gOhNHUeile2cqARBoexs","studentName":"Lily htike","userId":"uTkdJG2fRMSo1eC66WzHfhPAiby2","questionIndex":4,"answerContent":"they are a spiritual practitioner who wears brown robes dyed with natural tree bark and often wears a distinct tall hat","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-11T00:28:24.391Z"},{"id":"dlIhmizB8YhlpVbCDGUa","lessonId":"gOhNHUeile2cqARBoexs","studentName":"Mabel Naing","userId":"16685285020362320583","